#! ia 1.0

@distribution ia-product-base-distribution
  meaning
    says "The release root of the public IA product base kit: product-base-system with the prd word, its canonical schema and authoring guide, ratification and decomposition rules, and the offline check-prds verifier."
    answers "Which records does the IA product base kit release ship?"
  distribution
